# Tower of Coireall's "{T}: Target creature can't be blocked by Walls this turn" makes a rule of Tower's card, whatever
# the object it resolves for has become (CR 113.7a). Animate Artifact makes Tower a 2/2 artifact creature on turn 1, and
# on turn 3 Cubwarden mutates over it, on top (CR 702.140c): the merged creature is a Cubwarden, no artifact (the Aura
# falls off, CR 704.5m), with Tower's ability too (CR 702.140e). On turn 5 the merged creature taps for it, targeting a
# Cat token, and Bot2's Wall of Wood cannot block that Cat: Bot2 takes 1 and Bot1 gains 1 from its lifelink.

